From d62ceee9108d8a6620c2bf9d1490969c81ec7751 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ammar <surfmemo58@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 02:18:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Pane: Legion tab, rapid charge and re-selection crash
 fixes; 1.6.1

YogaSMCPane:
- Legion tab built in code (power mode, sensors refreshed every 2 s,
  touchpad lock / Win key lock / overdrive when supported)
- Fix crash on the second willSelect: removed tabs were freed, leaving weak
  outlets (indicatorCheck) nil for updateMain; keep them in removedTabs
- Wire the Rapid Charge checkbox (never connected in the nib), show it off
  and disabled while IdeaVPC reports "unsupported"
- NSPrincipalClass YogaSMCPane.YogaSMCPane (the old value never resolved)
- Tools/build-pane.sh: CLT-only build reusing the 1.5.3 nib

IdeaVPC: re-check the rapid charge capability on every battery update
(Legion GBMD sets it only while the EC allows quick charge), publish the
rapid charge state instead of the conservation state after toggling.

YogaSMCNC: show Rapid Charge as unavailable instead of a dead toggle.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
